;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">考勤：</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王一行</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">远足拍照：</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">摄影社（高三学生）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">远足报道：</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高三学生</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">远足情况考评：</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王一行</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">说明：各班随队老师由班主任安排具体任务；（如有特殊情况需要请假，请告知考勤</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王一行</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>三、纪律要求及注意事项</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1.活动前，班主任要做好安全教育和调查工作，体质特殊和身体不佳的学生，不宜参加。参加和不参加的学生都要填写好“申请书”（“申请书”由班主任保存）。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.出发前以及返回学校，班主任都要组织专人清点人数；班主任活动中要随带家长联系电话，保证紧急情况下的即时联系。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>四、学生安全要求</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1.遇到困难，及时联络。带队领导电话：</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王琛：</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">85170666</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；蒋明：</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">9299112</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；施笑程：</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">9299067</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；金笛：</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">9296815</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">何隽豪：9292077。</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">随队医生：范国娟</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">9299021</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.每位学生统一穿校服，选择合适</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">运动鞋；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3.</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">每位学生</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在车上请站稳坐好，注意安全，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">不得自行走动，不得将手、头伸到窗外，以免发生意外；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4.注意饮食安全，不浪费；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.全体师生，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">服从教官安排</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">不单独行动</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，学生</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">活动期间服从</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教官</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">管理，积极参与，不打闹嬉戏，有事须先打报告，经教官批准后方可离队</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.同学之间相互照顾，注意安全，看管好私人物品</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">7</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.注重形象：不丢一点垃圾，不在公共场合高声喧哗、追逐打闹，文明有礼，遵守</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">铁血避风塘基地</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的各项规定；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">8</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">.每次上车必须点好名；</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">注意返程时间</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">返程时</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人齐的班级先发车。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.30in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">                                                    </span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">德育处</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">                   </span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">                                 </span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">202</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">年</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">月</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">28</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日</span></p>
    
